OL,3,GNEWSABirders flock to shopping park to 
OL,4,Asee waxwings                           
OL,6,FBirdwatchers have been gathering at a  
OL,7,Fretail park to see a flock of birds    
OL,8,Fwhich do not breed in the UK.          
OL,10,FWaxwings are most commonly found in the
OL,11,Fforests of Scandinavia and Western     
OL,12,FRussia and migrate to the UK in the    
OL,13,Fwinter in search of berries, their     
OL,14,Ffavourite food.                        
OL,16,FBut a flock of about 30 has been       
OL,17,Fspotted at the Albion Retail Park in   
OL,18,FBlyth, Northumberland, this week, with 
OL,19,Fbirders travelling miles to catch a    
OL,20,Fglimpse.                               
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
