OL,3,GNEWSABirders flock to shopping park to 
OL,4,Asee waxwings                           
OL,6,F"There are a lot of people who travel a
OL,7,Fdistance to come and see these birds," 
OL,8,FBlyth birder Wayne Eastlake said. "If  
OL,9,Fthey're there regularly, it's going to 
OL,10,Fbe worth the journey."                 
